title: "Air-Gapped MLOps Platform (AGM)"
abstract: >-
  An open reference implementation for ML model lifecycle management in
  network-isolated Kubernetes environments. Includes the AGM four-plane
  reference architecture, a twelve-policy Kyverno ML admission library,
  and Container-Model Binding Attestation (CMBA).
